.TH geectl-gitea-repo-list 1  "geectl-gitea-repo-list 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-gitea\-repo\-list \- List repositories: the token owner\*(Aqs own repos, one user\*(Aqs repos with `\-\-owner`, one organization\*(Aqs with `\-\-org`, or both (the user\*(Aqs first, then the organization\*(Aqs)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl gitea repo\-list\fR [\fB\-\-owner\fR] [\fB\-\-org\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List repositories: the token owner\*(Aqs own repos, one user\*(Aqs repos with `\-\-owner`, one organization\*(Aqs with `\-\-org`, or both (the user\*(Aqs first, then the organization\*(Aqs)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-owner\fR \fI<OWNER>\fR
List this user\*(Aqs repositories instead of the token owner\*(Aqs
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fI<ORG>\fR
List this organization\*(Aqs repositories instead of (or, with `\-\-owner`, after) the user\*(Aqs
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
